>> Would this help my (lawful) alignment?

     That message is given when you #chat to a peaceful humanoid
who happens to be at less than 1/2 of its health.  It gives an
indication of how wounded the creature is, but aside from that
it is "flavor" and not an actual request to be given a potion.

