     Peaceful monsters do not pick up objects, so that you won't
be forced/tempted to kill them to recover items.  (Tame monsters
do pick things up, obviously, but they usually drop those soon
after.)  Peaceful item-using monsters will use some things that
they're already carrying; potions of healing fall into this
category.


